  "instructions": [
    "Combine egg yolks, olive oil, fenugreek seeds, ginger paste, salt, and black pepper in a blender. Blend until smooth.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a clay or ceramic tagine or a heavy-bottomed pot.",
    "Heat the mixture over medium heat, whisking constantly, until it thickens.",
    "Stir in dried apricots and water. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve over couscous or rice."
